Package: pcompress
Architecture: any
Depends: libpcompress1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: parallel compression, deduplication and encryption utility
 pcompress compresses files and directory trees in parallel chunks with a
 choice of algorithms (zstd, lzma, lz4, bzip2, ppmd, libbsc and adaptive
 modes), optional content-defined deduplication, and optional AES or
 XSalsa20 encryption with HMAC authentication.

Package: libpcompress1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: parallel compression, deduplication and encryption library
 The library behind pcompress: compression of streams and files to its
 own format, content-defined chunking, sealed chunk objects, key files and
 snapshot manifests for backup tools. lz4, zstd, libbsc and libarchive are
 built in and not exported.

Package: libpcompress-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libpcompress1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: parallel compression library - development files
 The header, pkg-config file and manual page for building programs that
 use libpcompress.
